    "chunk_text": "sie. Wi\u00fe sculdor w\u00e6rce & earma wyl betonican on ealo\u00f0, sele drincan gelome & simle smire hine \u00e6t Gif cneow sar sie cnua beolenan & hemlic, be\u00fee mid & lege on. Gif se fot sar sie, ellen leaf & wegbr\u00e6dan & mucgwyrt gecnua & lege on & gebind hat \u00fe\u00e6r on. Gif \u00feu ne m\u00e6ge blod dolh forwri\u00fean nim niwe horses tord, adrig on sunnan, gegnid to duste swi\u00fee Gif meoluc sie awyrd bind tosomne wegbr\u00e6dan & gi\u00ferifan & cersan, lege on \u00feone fildcumb & ne Wyrc sealfe wi\u00f0 nihtgengan, wyl on buteran elehtran, hegerifan, bisceopwyrt, reade mag\u00fean, Him bi\u00f0 sona sel. Gif men sio heafod panne beo gehlenced alege \u00feone man upweard, drif II stacan \u00e6t \u00feam eaxlum, Hio g\u00e6\u00fe on riht sona. Gif men nelle myltan his mete, ni\u00feeweard clate & merce & sundcornes leaf wyl on eala\u00fe, sele Wi\u00fe wif gem\u00e6dlan geberge on neaht nestig r\u00e6dices moran. \u00dey d\u00e6ge ne m\u00e6g \u00fee se gem\u00e6dla sce\u00fe\u00fean. Wi\u00fe feondes costunge, rud molin hatte wyrt, weaxe\u00fe be yrnendum w\u00e6tre, gif \u00feu \u00fea on \u00fee hafast & Wi\u00fe \u00feeor wenne, gif he sie men on cneowe o\u00fe\u00fee on o\u00ferum lime wyrc clam of surre rigenre grut Wyrc gode earsealfe, hundes tunge ni\u00feeweard & singrene & sinfulle, tunhofe nio\u00feoweard, E",
